+"@agent-wechat/cli": patch
+---
+
+Extend opt-in private quote-send diagnostics with typed RPC phases for DNS/TCP setup, a fresh MMTLS handshake, request preparation, shortlink HTTP and response decoding. Records retain the existing intent and attempt correlation and omit endpoints, content, credentials and raw errors. Diagnostics require an effective-user-owned regular stdout file with mode 0600; transport, authentication, send ordering and retries are unchanged.
